mpted:\n- restarting the editor\n- restarting the pc\n- deleting the .godot folder and re-importing files\n- deleting the entire project and re-cloning it from version control\n- running Godot as administrator\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOn the newest feature update to Windows 11, 24H2. Create a new project and try to interact with the editor on v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8].\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nOn the newest feature update to Windows 11, 24H2. Create a new project and try to interact with the editor on v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8].","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102095/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102095/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}